<blockquote>
<p>[I]t could've questioned the straight definition of a demon. Why is it an abrahamic demon academy? There are other &quot;demon&quot; like entities that aren't necessarily &quot;evil&quot; according to the stereotype perception of it. You could have a lot of fun representing a lot of ideas on what a demon is and what evil is and what a demonic pet project is, but here it's very laid out and exactly as expected given the thing.</p>
